  "title": "ASYMPTOTICS OF q-PLANCHEREL MEASURES",
  "authors_raw": "V ALENTIN F\u00c9RAY AND PIERRE-LO\u00cfC M\u00c9LIOT",
  "title_lines": [
   "ASYMPTOTICS OF q-PLANCHEREL MEASURES"
  ],
  "abstract": "In this paper, we are interested in the asymptotic size of the rows and columns of a random Young diagram under a natural deformation of the Plancherel measure coming from Hecke algebras. The \ufb01rst lines of such diagrams are typically of order n, so it does not \ufb01t in the context of the work of P. Biane and P. \u015aniady. Using the theory of polynomial func tions on Young diagrams of Kerov and Olshanski, we are able to compute explicitly the \ufb01rst- and se cond-order asymptotics of the length of the \ufb01rst rows. Our method also works for other measures, for e xample those coming from Schur-W eyl representations.",
